WEBVTT

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.493 line:85%
Choosing a university is a big decision.

00:00:04.693 --> 00:00:06.323 line:85%
And the numbers are everywhere.

00:00:06.623 --> 00:00:11.611 line:85%
Seventy-four admission codes. Nine programs. Cut-offs that change every year.

00:00:12.661 --> 00:00:15.476 line:85%
So I built a counselor that knows every one of them.

00:00:15.526 --> 00:00:16.975 line:85%
Meet BKAi!

00:00:18.425 --> 00:00:21.790 line:85%
Ask anything, in Vietnamese, the way you'd ask a friend.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.745 line:85%
A team of AI agents finds the facts, in about two seconds.

00:00:27.995 --> 00:00:31.536 line:85%
Every number comes with its source, and is checked before you see it.

00:00:32.886 --> 00:00:35.659 line:85%
Rather talk? Just speak. You can even interrupt!

00:00:36.909 --> 00:00:40.260 line:85%
It remembers your scores, and suggests majors that fit you.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:44.302 line:85%
And every answer can be traced, step by step.

00:00:45.652 --> 00:00:47.411 line:85%
Eight out of eight real cases.

00:00:47.561 --> 00:00:50.706 line:85%
Two hundred out of two hundred numbers, exactly right.

00:00:50.856 --> 00:00:52.821 line:85%
Fifteen times faster than before.

00:00:53.871 --> 00:00:55.093 line:85%
BKAi.

00:00:55.343 --> 00:00:56.965 line:85%
Every number has a source.
